e up  there that tie is a tie that mr rogers  wore not actually one that he wore but  he wore that that plaid which our dad  bought for me you probably got one too  john he's a good dad and then of course  we got the meat furby and up there's the  bean furby very good pizza john thank  you to this person and of course we  still have and we'll always have the map  of the realm of narnia behind me that's  the kurt's gazette calendar this is my  first ever badge to a vidcon so that's  what it looks like in here this is the  place where i spend  a lot of my time i hope that was  somewhat enjoyable for you i know it was  for me john i'll see you on tuesday

